63
00:02:31,887 --> 00:02:33,337
So here I want to have a title,

64
00:02:34,460 --> 00:02:34,767
let's say

65
00:02:35,302 --> 00:02:35,609
Demo

66
00:02:36,597 --> 00:02:37,504
the Course,

