00:03:27,773 --> 00:03:29,805
With that, if we now click send,

85
00:03:30,853 --> 00:03:34,282
we get back this response. We see that we

86
00:03:34,298 --> 00:03:35,806
have an inserted resource

87
00:03:36,383 --> 00:03:38,453
